# Build context is trainer/. Keep the image to just the Python package —
# exclude notebooks, caches, docs, shell scripts, and the Docker files
# themselves. Only *.py + requirements-lock.txt need to land in the image.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.ipynb
*.md
*.sh
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.last_image
requirements.txt
*.egg-info/
